{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_33","type":"agent_message","text":"The prior child-veto fix is present: `unreviewed_milestones` can suppress a nonterminal child only under legacy policy. The association parser also rejects the malformed declarations listed in the brief, and `git diff --check` passes.\n\nI found a possible gap in how a done roadmap is classified as historical. I’m checking whether an approval made after adoption can bypass the required receipt."}}
