{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_52","type":"command_execution","command":"/usr/bin/bash -lc \"rg -n 'func cmdValidate|json-out|Mkdir|WriteFile|report|results' pose-mcp/internal/cli/validate.go\"","aggregated_output":"307:// ranNone reports that Go named packages and said of each that it ran no test.\n735:// isAndroidModule reports whether a Gradle module directory is an Android\n760:// reason in the structured result (spec pose-structured-validation-results).\n892:func cmdValidate(root string, args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) int {\n898:func cmdValidateWithStore(store posemodel.Store, args []string, stdout, stderr io.Writer) int {\n901:\tmode, stackFilter, moduleFilter, reportTask := \"\", \"\", \"\", \"\"\n917:\t\tcase \"--report\":\n930:\t\tcase \"--stack\", \"--module\", \"--workspace\", \"--report-task\", \"--json\", \"--json-out\", \"--junit\", \"--sarif\", \"--emit-plan\", \"--changed-from\", \"--changed-to\", \"--jobs\":\n954:\t\t\tcase \"--report-task\":\n955:\t\t\t\treportTask = args[i]\n956:\t\t\tcase \"--json-out\":\n963:\t\t\t\trender(stdout, stderr).Hint(cliText(locale, \"validate --json <path> is deprecated; use --json-out <path>.\", \"validate --json <path> está depreciado; use --json-out <path>.\"))\n1001:\t// The report --report writes records this run, so it reads this run's own\n1003:\t// validation never writes, and every report said \"Fill manually\" and \"No\n1005:\t// pose-validate-report-carries-its-run).\n1006:\t// The report records this run from the run's own structured result, not\n1244:\t// Checks run up to jobs at a time; results are shown and counted here,\n1413:\t\tif err := os.MkdirAll(filepath.Dir(target), 0o755); err != nil {\n1433:\t\t\tSpec:          reportTask,\n1450:\t\tif reportTask == \"\" {\n1451:\t\t\treportTask = \"validate-native\"\n1453:\t\treportArgs := []string{\"--task\", reportTask, \"--context\", \"auto-validate\", \"--validation-profile\", mode}\n1456:\t\t_ = runReportWith(root, reportArgs, nil, validationSummaryOf(run), io.Discard, stderr)\n1464:// validationSummaryOf projects a finished run for `pose report`: the commands\n1517:\t// The report records the run's verdict too, built from the outcome rather\n1594:// materialWorktreeClean reports whether the working copy equals HEAD in every\n1627:// materialTrackedUnchanged reports whether no tracked file differs from HEAD\n1659:// administrativeRecordsAreRegular reports whether every changed administrative\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
